name: Find / Leave's 'Look for new Group' (ui_groupopt.cpp key 2) sends OPTION; a second click sets it back
# The toggle sends OPTION 0x002e, 9 bytes (pkoption.cpp's OptionPacketClass(int, int, bool), 0x89F490: game id,
# option type, the flag); the replay server ignores it. The second click sends the option back, so the scenario
# leaves the avatar as it found it; the close box closes Find / Leave (its fa_tsi25a.ini is read again on close).
timeout: 400
include _login
click gadget chat.tab.group
alive 0.5
click gadget group.findleave
expect-event proxy 'fa_tsi25a\.ini", R, disposition 3\) = ok' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
click gadget groupopt.looking
expect-event antprox 'received OPTION 0x002e, 9 bytes' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
shot group_looking
click gadget groupopt.looking
expect-event antprox 'received OPTION 0x002e, 9 bytes' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
click gadget groupopt.close
expect-event proxy 'fa_tsi25a\.ini", R, disposition 3\) = ok' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
